stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> OFFLINE
  OFFLINE --> HANDSHAKE: authenticated connection
  HANDSHAKE --> FENCED: stale generation/epoch/instance
  HANDSHAKE --> READY: authorized reconnect plan + exact topology
  HANDSHAKE --> RECOVERING: FETCH_DELTA / REBUILD_RANK
  RECOVERING --> READY: objects verified + attach barrier pending
  RECOVERING --> QUARANTINED: integrity/shape/provenance failure
  READY --> SNAPSHOTTING: BeginCheckpoint current epoch
  SNAPSHOTTING --> PREPARED: pages + rank manifest durable
  SNAPSHOTTING --> READY: cancel/abort before prepare
  SNAPSHOTTING --> FENCED: epoch superseded
  PREPARED --> COMMITTED_LOCAL: authoritative certificate observed
  PREPARED --> READY: authoritative abort; orphan cleanup deferred
  PREPARED --> FENCED: epoch superseded; no current mutation
  COMMITTED_LOCAL --> READY: checkpoint complete
  READY --> FENCED: authority fence / duplicate instance
  READY --> QUARANTINED: corruption detected
  FENCED --> OFFLINE: terminate old instance
  QUARANTINED --> RECOVERING: independent repair plan
  QUARANTINED --> OFFLINE: reset/terminate
